# vercel
.vercel

# The repository-root .gitignore is Python-oriented and contains a `lib/` rule,
# which would silently exclude BOYD'S core library (src/lib). Re-include it here
# rather than editing the root file, which belongs to the unrelated Sennicare
# project. Without this, every money and calculation module would be missing
# from the repository while still passing locally.
!src/lib/
